# Quarter Math

Deterministic quarter arithmetic using explicit dates.

## Calendar-Correct Month Arithmetic

jan_end = Jan 31 2026
feb_from_jan = Jan 31 2026 + 1 month
mar_from_jan = Jan 31 2026 + 2 months
next_year = Jan 15 2026 + 1 year

## Leap Year Handling

leap_day = Feb 29 2024
after_leap = Feb 29 2024 + 1 year
month_after_leap = Feb 29 2024 + 1 month

## Month Clipping

mar_end = Mar 31 2026
feb_from_mar = Mar 31 2026 - 1 month
apr_from_mar = Mar 31 2026 + 1 month

## Year Boundary Arithmetic

dec_date = Dec 15 2026
jan_from_dec = Dec 15 2026 + 1 month
three_months = Dec 15 2026 + 3 months

## Duration Composition

start = Jan 1 2026
half_year = Jan 1 2026 + 6 months
quarter_later = Jan 1 2026 + 3 months
two_and_half = Jan 1 2026 + 2 months + 15 days

## Date Differences

q1_start = Jan 1 2026
q2_start = Apr 1 2026
q1_length = Apr 1 2026 - Jan 1 2026
